<Prose title="Affiliate Disclosure – ZIPCodeDetails" description="How ZIPCodeDetails earns money from advertising and partner links, and how we keep our data independent." heading="Affiliate & advertising disclosure" crumb="Affiliate disclosure" path="/affiliate-disclosure/">
  <p>{SITE.brand} is free to use. To pay for hosting and development, we earn money in two ways:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Advertising</strong>, including Google AdSense. Ads are labeled “Advertisement”.</li>
    <li><strong>Partner (affiliate) links</strong> to services such as moving quotes, internet providers, insurance comparison and hotel booking. If you click one and buy or sign up, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. These links are marked as partner links and use <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>As an Amazon Associate we may earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
  <h2>Our promise</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Partners never pay to change our ZIP code data, rankings or comparisons.</li>
    <li>We only feature services that are relevant to the page you’re on.</li>
    <li>Official free options (such as the USPS change-of-address service) are always shown alongside partner offers.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
</Prose>
